# Adapters ship as executable scripts and CI configs installed directly into
# other projects' .git/hooks/ or .github/workflows/. A CRLF line ending breaks
# a shebang line on Linux/CI even though the file still "looks fine" on
# Windows editors. Force LF for everything under Adapters/, regardless of the
# checkout platform or user's core.autocrlf setting.
/Adapters/** text eol=lf
